Hi, Eric.

It looks like the model will "run" in R as well since it makes it
through the zelig step.  Why don't you check to see if all of the IVs
that you include are output from the model-fitting step (e.g., do
summary on the output from zelig)?  If some are being dropped, it
probably indicates that those IVs are collinear with each other (and
shouldn't be included anyway).

Yours,
Olivia

